{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1793088193","published":"2026-10-27T08:03:32Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:16:22.986788760Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-106568","CVE-2026-106573","CVE-2026-106578","CVE-2026-106579","CVE-2026-106580","CVE-2026-109263","CVE-2026-109264","CVE-2026-109275","CVE-2026-109278"],"summary":"Fix of 9 CVEs","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: infinite loop in XML entity validation via a crafted\n     XMP profile\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106568.patch: add a delimiter parameter to\n       ValidateEntities() and validate both '%' and '&' entity references\n       in ParseInternalDoctype() in magick/xml-tree.c\n     - CVE-2026-106568\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: resource exhaustion via MVG macro expansion\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106573.patch: limit the number of 'use' macro\n       expansions per DrawImage() call in RenderMVGContent() in magick/draw.c\n     - CVE-2026-106573\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: invalid memory free in the MVG decoder\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106578.patch: pad the CheckPrimitiveExtent()\n       call with coordinates+1 in RenderMVGContent() in magick/draw.c\n     - CVE-2026-106578\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: coder security policy bypass\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106579.patch: check the coder policy against\n       the coder actually used (magick_info->name) in ReadImage() and\n       WriteImage() in magick/constitute.c\n     - CVE-2026-106579\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: path policy bypass via CUT palette files\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106580.patch: check the path policy before\n       opening a palette file in ReadCUTImage() in coders/cut.c\n     - CVE-2026-106580\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: memory leak in the YUV encoder\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-109263.patch: destroy yuv_image when the\n       chroma resize fails and destroy chroma_image after the adjoin loop in\n       WriteYUVImage() in coders/yuv.c\n     - CVE-2026-109263\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: uncontrolled recursion in nested image reads\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-109264.patch: add a coder_depth counter to\n       ImageInfo in magick/image.c and limit nested image reads to 250 in\n       DrawPrimitive() in magick/draw.c and SVGEndElement() in coders/svg.c\n     - CVE-2026-109264\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: PostScript code injection via a crafted font name\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-109275.patch: add IsValidPostscriptFontname()\n       and use it in RenderPostscript() in magick/annotate.c\n     - CVE-2026-109275\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: memory leak in wavelet denoise on allocation failure\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-109278.patch: destroy noise_image before\n       throwing in WaveletDenoiseImage() in magick/fx.c\n     - CVE-2026-109278","affected":[{"package":{"name":"imagemagick","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/imagemagick?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8:6.9.10.23+dfsg-2.1+deb10u7+tuxcare.els23"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1793088193.json"}},{"package":{"name":"imagemagick-6-common","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/imagemagick-6-common?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8:6.9.10.23+dfsg-2.1+deb10u7+tuxcare.els23"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1793088193.json"}},{"package":{"name":"imagemagick-6-doc","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/imagemagick-6-doc?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8:6.9.10.23+dfsg-2.1+deb10u7+tuxcare.els23"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1793088193.json"}},{"package":{"name":"imagemagick-6.q16","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/imagemagick-6.q16?distro=debian-10"},"range